should you start a for-profit or  non-profit company  if you really want to help people if you  really want to have a big  impact and reach a ton of people for the  better  then in my opinion the best way to do it  is to have a for-profit company that  gives  back to the community i got a great  question from a reader greg  who he wants to start up a business he  wants to help  nursing homes and artists and he wants  to start a business around that that can  give back and he's not sure if it should  be a for-profit  or non-profit business here's the thing  okay if you  are just doing a non-profit if it's just  you if you're trying to raise money  through donations  you're always going to be limited if you  are out just volunteering for a company  you can have an  impact and that might be a really  meaningful contribution that you are  giving your time to something  but if you really want to have a big  impact if you want to help more than a  few people  then the best way to do it is to build a  highly profitable business  and invest the money that you make back  into  the causes that you support here's an  example of a friend of mine  he runs a a design shop and he'll help  create great products for companies and  one of the challenges he had when he was  starting up was  i love working with with these  non-profits with these charities because  i love that they're all about i love  their cause  but if i do that i'm not making money  right i either do it at a loss i do it  for free i do it at cost i'm not making  money  so his opportunity here is either do i  go and  basically just work with these  non-profits  and give them my services and i love  doing that work and this may be  personally fulfilling  but he's always going to be limited by  how much time he has  he's never going to be able to grow and  scale and build a team  because he's not making money  whereas if he were to go out and build a  design shop that is for profit that is  doing work  for companies who pay him who pay him  what he's worth because he has  mad skills and then donate 10  of his time 20 of his time whatever it  is back  to helping those causes then in the  longer run he'll have  much more impact because it's not just  going to be  him and his time it can be his team  where if you're just volunteering if  you're just donating  your time or you're you're believing a  cause and you're just investing your  time into something  you're building a non-profit then it's  going to be so  limited it could be 100 of your time but  it's harder to build up  a team around you whereas if you're a  for-profit company  you're making lots of money you bring on  a team say you're a 10-person company  a 20 person company if everybody's  giving 20  of their time to this cause with tons of  different skill sets  you're gonna have a much greater impact  so that's my challenge to you how much  of an impact you want to have  and really the decision you have to make  is  the first option you can get personally  involved and it will be very  personally fulfilling for you because  it's your time but you're not going to  make a lot of money  doing it if anything but you're giving  everything you got to it  whereas the other one you're not giving  as much time to it  but you're having a bigger impact  because you have a business  that can support the causes that you  belong to i'm a big believer that  entrepreneurs need to give back to their  community  if it's through sponsorships if it's  through you know dollars if it's through  time if it's through mentoring whatever  it is  something that you proudly believe in  make that part of your business  bring that into what you do as a company  but then it's still a for-profit  business and the bigger that i can grow  my business  the bigger that you can grow your  business the greater  positive impact you can have in your  community and afford  to give more dollars and resources and  time of yourself  and your team to support the causes that  you believe in  so if i was ever given the option i  would always pick  go for profit have a huge impact change  the world  and believe for those of you watching  like the video please give it a thumbs  up below it always makes me want to do  more for you and let me know what you  think leave a comment underneath you  like this video  stop just being a stalker leave a  comment say something i love to hear  from you and if you have a question  leave it below i'll make a video  response thank you so much i'll see you  soon
 

